{
  "name": "Personal_Force_Field",
  "full_name": "Corruptor_Buff.Force_Field.Personal_Force_Field",
  "short_name": "Personal_Force_Field",
  "type": "Toggle",
  "display_name": "Personal Force Field",
  "display_fullname": "Corruptor Buff Force Field Personal Force Field",
  "display_help": "The Personal Force Field is almost impenetrable to all attacks, even Psionics and Enemy Teleportation, although attacks from more powerful foes may get through more easily. Personal Force Field will also reduce the damage of almost any attacks that do get through. Personal Force Field does not cost any endurance, and you may initially attack while using it. However, pushing through such a powerful field is taxing, so after 30 seconds your powers will no longer be able to affect targets outside the force field until you deactivate it. Due to the field's power you cannot activate Personal Force Field more often than once every 120 seconds. Cannot be used with Rest. Recharge: Slow",
  "display_short_help": "Toggle: Self +Def, Res(All except Toxic)",
